<title>UK: Horse racing-Make A Stand wins Champion Hurdle.</title>
<headline>Horse racing-Make A Stand wins Champion Hurdle.</headline>
<dateline>CHELTENHAM, England 1997-03-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Make A Stand, ridden by Tony McCoy, won the Champion Hurdle run over two miles (3.2 kms) on Tuesday.</p>
</text>
